The Problem

The `criteria_list` that comes out of the planner is nested. One criterion (`id: "C1"`) might have **multiple** `check_points`:


[
  {
    "id": "C1",
    "check_points": [
      "营业执照是否过期",
      "注册资本是否足够"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "C2",
    "check_points": [
      "合同金额大小写不一致"
    ]
  }
]

To ask the LLM (CheckpointEnricher) to expand these, we need to send it a **flat list** of things to enrich. But if we just send the text strings, we won't know which enriched text belongs to which original criterion when the LLM replies.

