                items.append({"id": f"{c['id']}_cp{i}", "check_point": cp})

Notice that we explicitly assign `f"{c['id']}_cp{i}"` to the `"id"` field in the JSON we generate. We don't send just `"C1"`. We send `"C1_cp0"`.

