                # item["id"] here is "C1_cp0" because the LLM mirrored what we sent it
                enriched_map[item["id"]] = item.get("enriched_text", item.get("original", ""))

At this point, `enriched_map` looks like this:


enriched_map = {
    "C1_cp0": "审查说明：比较合同金额与注册资本...",
    "C1_cp1": "审查说明：登录企查查检查..."
