Finally, we loop through the original data one last time to put everything back together (lines 101-105):


        for c in criteria_list:
            c["enriched_guidance"] = []
            for i, cp in enumerate(c.get("check_points", [])):
                # We calculate the exact same string again: "C1_cp0"
